{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/67cc0c3718a7c513a1f9dd207a434e4e.poster.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/67cc0c3718a7c513a1f9dd207a434e4e.webm?t=1772854742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/b174440fc7fb11b6314d5fdf752d6cb8.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1560 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the kingdoms most renowned\u00a0troublemaker!</strong> Rebel against the King by disrupting the peace and wreaking havoc across his realm. Master a flexible spell casting system to destroy your foes in fast paced, chaotic scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique spell casting system that makes you feel like you're weaving spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced, chaotic combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through hoards of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable morals</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/1131f0f7c863a308a9038b1712a90bfd.poster.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1170 height=458 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/1131f0f7c863a308a9038b1712a90bfd.webm?t=1772854742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/1131f0f7c863a308a9038b1712a90bfd.mp4?t=1772854742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/f4653dcf4a92ea3cd4fa3d15f7902c89.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a breather from trouble making to try on some new hats and see if last year\u2019s robe still fits. Customize your look to boost your stats or simply to intimidate the King's guard with your impeccable dresswork. Use your slightly too long wizard pipe to improve your stats even further!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your look with 100's of hats, robes &amp; trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level-up and increase your wizards stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wizard pipe for temporary stat buffs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase furniture and decorations to customize your wizard tower</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/82e640a12d0295252c00adde87eaaf44.poster.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1170 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/82e640a12d0295252c00adde87eaaf44.webm?t=1772854742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/669665ae720546a16c4a768c2de8487d.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every location in SpellChain changes depending on the day of the week, if you missed blowing up yesterday\u2019s market, don\u2019t worry, there's a lovely wedding on today that needs crashing  and the village thief's beheading is right around the corner! Don't expect your doings go unnoticed, at the end of every week expect a Boss fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Unique level events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations change depending on the day of the week</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Bosses to fight through, including The King</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/229915f8cb1f24fd9415275af93e42df.poster.avif?t=1772854742\" width=1170 height=461 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/extras/229915f8cb1f24fd9415275af93e42df.webm?t=1772854742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3573120?t=1772854742","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/fa081c4f6f74305bb404b29e65a5f802252782fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772854742","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/bf67a2e640af49967a3f12d275b9ae9919dde2b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772854742","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3573120/bf67a2e640af49967a3f12d275b9ae9919dde2b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772854742","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"d